This add-on allows you to link items by shift-clicking them.

Currently limited to linking items from your inventory, including equipped items.

More chat linking functionality is planned, stay tuned!

[SIZE="4"][B]Dependencies[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE="3"]The following dependencies are needed for the add-on to work:

[LIST]
[*]LibAddonMenu-2.0
[/LIST][/SIZE]
